    "reading_time": "3 min read",
    "tag": "News",
    "likes": 652,
    "views": "18.3k",
    "featured": false,
    "body_html": "<div class=\"article-lead\"><p class=\"lead-text\"><strong>⚠️ You're Using ChatGPT's New Memory Feature Wrong</strong></p><p>I unlocked its true potential. Here's how.</p></div>\n<div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">I&#x27;ve been using ChatGPT with memory on for a while across work, side projects, and personal planning.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">With the new memory updates announced recently, it got me thinking: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>was I actually using my full chat history to its full potential?</em></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">I knew my chat history was a goldmine of information, but it was just a passive archive. I needed a way to leverage all that stored knowledge to get truly personalized results.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">So, I tried a prompt that completely changed my experience. It was the key to unlocking a new level of usefulness from the feature.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Here&#x27;s the prompt I used to finally leverage my full chat history. It works best if you have a solid history built up.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" ><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" ><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" ><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><em>Based on everything you know about me from our full chat history and memory, give me 10 high-leverage ways I should be using AI that I haven’t yet considered. Prioritize ideas that are tailored to my habits, goals, and work/life patterns even if they’re unconventional or unexpected.</em></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">The results were spot-on. It didn&#x27;t give me generic ideas. It recommended systems and automations that perfectly matched how I think and work, including niche ideas based on things I had only mentioned in passing.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">What felt like a useless feature suddenly became a powerful, personalized tool.</span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">If you&#x27;ve been using ChatGPT with memory on, this prompt could be a powerful tool for discovering new workflows and ideas. Give it a shot, and you might walk away with a few new ideas you can start using right away.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">What was the most unexpected or useful idea you received? Hit reply and let me know!</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Until next time,</span><br/><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>AIRA</strong></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"></div></div></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col\" ><h3 id=\"5e66c1b6-175b-4ef2-a21d-79857031cd07\" class=\"v3sg6r0 v3sg6r3\" ><span class=\"_11r14xt0\"><span  class=\"_11r14xt1\">\n<div class=\"author-signoff\" style=\"margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);\">Until next time,<br><strong>AIRA</strong></div>"
